<!--
  Super-Kamiokande I-V alone: Delta chi^2 lattice scan of record.

  Engine     the SK kernel "Ninv": the response matrix of the 7.2 x100 MC
             pinned per (species, analysis bin) to the SK release NO best-fit tables;
             all 930 analysis bins fitted; pure Poisson likelihood; the engine adds its
             own Gaussian prior over the 136 parameters below.
  Protocol   per lattice cell (Delta m^2_31, sin^2 theta_23), the delta_CP nodes in the
             region's order; each node is one L-BFGS-B fit plus 2 restarts kept if
             lower, seeded from the previous node (the first node from start_NO/IO, the
             SK-alone best fit).
  Region     20 x 20 cells around each ordering's best fit, odd delta_CP nodes.
  Parameters lo/hi are the engine's box (nominal +- 10 sigma, floor 0.01, fixed boxes
             for ratio and shape parameters); pinned parameters stay at nominal.
-->
